#: plugin header
msgid "Vehicle lookup in Statens vegvesen by registration number or VIN. Provides variables (shortcodes and tokens), ready-made blocks and WPBakery elements that follow the theme's styling."
msgstr "Kjøretøysøk i Statens vegvesen etter registreringsnummer eller understellsnummer. Gir variabler (kortkoder og tokens), ferdige blokker og WPBakery-elementer som følger temaets stil."

#: plugin header
msgid "Bruktdeler – Vegvesen Vehicle Lookup"
msgstr "Bruktdeler – Vegvesen kjøretøysøk"

#: includes\class-bv-render.php
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Innstillinger"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "Variabler"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Vegvesen – settings"
msgstr "Vegvesen – innstillinger"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Demo mode is on."
msgstr "Demomodus er på."

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "The site shows sample data (Volkswagen Passat) for any number. The number XX00000 simulates \"not found\". To get real data, add an API key and turn off demo mode."
msgstr "Nettstedet viser eksempeldata (Volkswagen Passat) for alle numre. Nummeret XX00000 simulerer «ikke funnet». For å få ekte data, legg inn en API-nøkkel og slå av demomodus."

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Statens vegvesen API"
msgstr "API fra Statens vegvesen"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "API key"
msgstr "API-nøkkel"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "The key is set with the <code>BV_API_KEY</code> constant in <code>wp-config.php</code>."
msgstr "Nøkkelen er satt med konstanten <code>BV_API_KEY</code> i <code>wp-config.php</code>."

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "•••••••• (saved)"
msgstr "•••••••• (lagret)"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "remove"
msgstr "fjern"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "It is safer to set the key in <code>wp-config.php</code>: <code>define( 'BV_API_KEY', 'your-key' );</code> – then it is not stored in the database."
msgstr "Det er tryggere å sette nøkkelen i <code>wp-config.php</code>: <code>define( 'BV_API_KEY', 'din-nøkkel' );</code> – da lagres den ikke i databasen."

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Demo mode"
msgstr "Demomodus"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Show sample data instead of calling Vegvesen"
msgstr "Vis eksempeldata i stedet for å kalle Vegvesen"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "API URL"
msgstr "API-adresse"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "The <code>?kjennemerke=</code> or <code>?understellsnummer=</code> parameter is added automatically."
msgstr "Parameteren <code>?kjennemerke=</code> eller <code>?understellsnummer=</code> legges til automatisk."

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Authorization header"
msgstr "Autorisasjonsheader"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Sent as: %s"
msgstr "Sendes som: %s"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Cache, hours"
msgstr "Mellomlagring, timer"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "How long to keep the response for one number. Saves the daily request quota."
msgstr "Hvor lenge svaret for ett nummer lagres. Sparer den daglige kvoten."

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Search limit"
msgstr "Søkegrense"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "new requests per minute from one IP address (0 = no limit)"
msgstr "nye forespørsler per minutt fra én IP-adresse (0 = ingen grense)"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Page and appearance"
msgstr "Side og utseende"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Result page"
msgstr "Resultatside"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "— not selected —"
msgstr "— ikke valgt —"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "View"
msgstr "Vis"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Edit page"
msgstr "Rediger side"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "The search field leads here. The address looks like %s. The page can be built in any page builder using the variables."
msgstr "Søkefeltet leder hit. Adressen ser slik ut: %s. Siden kan bygges i en hvilken som helst sidebygger med variablene."

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Preview number for editors"
msgstr "Forhåndsvisningsnummer for redaktører"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Inside page builders (WPBakery front-end editor, Elementor, Customizer) the variables show this vehicle when there is no number in the address, so you design with real data. On the normal site you see the same as visitors."
msgstr "I sidebyggere (frontend-redigering i WPBakery, Elementor, Tilpass) viser variablene dette kjøretøyet når det ikke er noe nummer i adressen, slik at du designer med ekte data. På det vanlige nettstedet ser du det samme som besøkende."

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "To see the preview on the site, add <code>?bv_preview=1</code> to the address."
msgstr "For å se forhåndsvisningen på nettstedet, legg <code>?bv_preview=1</code> til adressen."

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Inspection warning"
msgstr "Varsel om EU-kontroll"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "days before the deadline – the row turns yellow"
msgstr "dager før fristen – raden blir gul"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Primary colour"
msgstr "Hovedfarge"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "empty = theme colour"
msgstr "tom = temaets farge"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Empty uses the theme's primary colour (WoodMart: Theme Settings → Colors). Or enter your own, e.g. <code>#0b6e3a</code>."
msgstr "Tom bruker temaets hovedfarge (WoodMart: Theme Settings → Colors). Eller skriv inn din egen, f.eks. <code>#0b6e3a</code>."

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Lagre"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Search field. Attributes: layout=\"hero|compact\", title, subtitle, image (ID or URL), placeholder, button, max_width"
msgstr "Søkefelt. Attributter: layout=\"hero|compact\", title, subtitle, image (ID eller URL), placeholder, button, max_width"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "The whole vehicle card. Attributes: tiles, general, dates, miljo (field lists), print=\"0\", image=\"0\""
msgstr "Hele kjøretøykortet. Attributter: tiles, general, dates, miljo (feltlister), print=\"0\", image=\"0\""

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Number plate. size=\"small|large\""
msgstr "Kjennemerke. size=\"small|large\""

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "\"Vehicle found\" + last updated date. found=\"your text\", updated=\"0\""
msgstr "«Kjøretøy funnet» + dato for oppdatering. found=\"din tekst\", updated=\"0\""

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Vehicle picture: a media library image titled \"Make Model\" (e.g. \"Volkswagen Passat\"), otherwise a silhouette"
msgstr "Bilde av kjøretøyet: et bilde i mediebiblioteket med tittelen «Merke Modell» (f.eks. «Volkswagen Passat»), ellers en silhuett"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Print button. label=\"your text\""
msgstr "Utskriftsknapp. label=\"din tekst\""

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Tiles with icons. columns=\"4\""
msgstr "Fliser med ikoner. columns=\"4\""

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Table. highlight=\"neste_eu\", labels=\"merke:Brand\", hide_empty=\"0\". Icons: %s"
msgstr "Tabell. highlight=\"neste_eu\", labels=\"merke:Bilmerke\", hide_empty=\"0\". Ikoner: %s"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "The field's label (e.g. Kerb weight)"
msgstr "Feltets navn (f.eks. Egenvekt)"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "text after the value"
msgstr "tekst etter verdien"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "text before the value"
msgstr "tekst foran verdien"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "add the standard unit (kg, kW, g/km…)"
msgstr "legg til standard enhet (kg, kW, g/km…)"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "date format (month names follow the site language)"
msgstr "datoformat (månedsnavn følger nettstedets språk)"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "number without thousands separator (1615 instead of 1 615)"
msgstr "tall uten tusenskille (1615 i stedet for 1 615)"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "number of decimals"
msgstr "antall desimaler"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "what to show when there is no data"
msgstr "hva som vises når det ikke finnes data"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "show a specific vehicle instead of the one in the address"
msgstr "vis et bestemt kjøretøy i stedet for det i adressen"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "show if the field has a value"
msgstr "vis hvis feltet har en verdi"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "show if the field is empty"
msgstr "vis hvis feltet er tomt"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "the value is one of the list"
msgstr "verdien er en av listen"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "the value is not"
msgstr "verdien er ikke"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "search status: funnet (found), ikke_funnet (not found), ugyldig (invalid), feil (error), ingen (no number entered)"
msgstr "søkestatus: funnet, ikke_funnet, ugyldig, feil, ingen (ingen nummer oppgitt)"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Variables for pages"
msgstr "Variabler for sider"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "On the site, variables are replaced with data for the vehicle whose number is in the page address. There are two ways to insert them:"
msgstr "På nettstedet erstattes variablene med data for kjøretøyet som har nummeret i sideadressen. Det finnes to måter å sette dem inn på:"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "<strong>Shortcode <code>[bv field=\"merke\"]</code></strong> – in large text fields with an editor: Text Block, Info Box content, HTML Blocks, Gutenberg."
msgstr "<strong>Kortkode <code>[bv field=\"merke\"]</code></strong> – i store tekstfelt med redigeringsverktøy: Text Block, innholdet i Info Box, HTML Blocks, Gutenberg."

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "<strong>Token <code>{bv:merke}</code></strong> – in one-line fields where a shortcode does not work: WoodMart Title, Info Box title, button text, List items. Also works in text blocks."
msgstr "<strong>Token <code>{bv:merke}</code></strong> – i enlinjefelt der en kortkode ikke virker: WoodMart Title, tittel i Info Box, knappetekst, punkter i List. Virker også i tekstblokker."

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Variants: <code>{bv:egenvekt|unit}</code> → with unit, <code>{bv:neste_eu|j M Y}</code> → custom date format, <code>{bv:label:egenvekt}</code> → field label."
msgstr "Varianter: <code>{bv:egenvekt|unit}</code> → med enhet, <code>{bv:neste_eu|j. M Y}</code> → eget datoformat, <code>{bv:label:egenvekt}</code> → feltets navn."

