msgid "In the WPBakery front-end editor all elements stay visible, so they can be edited."
msgstr "I frontend-redigeringen i WPBakery er alle elementer synlige, slik at de kan redigeres."

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Ready-made blocks"
msgstr "Ferdige blokker"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Also available in WPBakery (category <strong>Vegvesen</strong>) with settings and a Design Options tab."
msgstr "Finnes også i WPBakery (kategorien <strong>Vegvesen</strong>) med innstillinger og fanen Design Options."

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Design"
msgstr "Design"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Colours and fonts come from the theme (WoodMart: Theme Settings). You can change them in the theme's Custom CSS, for example:"
msgstr "Farger og skrifter hentes fra temaet (WoodMart: Theme Settings). Du kan endre dem i temaets Custom CSS, for eksempel:"

#: includes\class-bv-admin.php
msgid "Templates can be overridden by copying a file from <code>wp-content/plugins/bruktdeler-vegvesen/templates/</code> to <code>wp-content/themes/your-child-theme/bruktdeler-vegvesen/</code>."
msgstr "Malene kan overstyres ved å kopiere en fil fra <code>wp-content/plugins/bruktdeler-vegvesen/templates/</code> til <code>wp-content/themes/ditt-undertema/bruktdeler-vegvesen/</code>."

